-tab-count: 1;\"> </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\"> </span></p><table style=\"border: currentColor; border-image: none; border-collapse: collapse; table-layout: fixed; mso-table-overlap: never;\"><tbody><tr><td valign=\"middle\" style=\"background: rgb(214, 214, 214); padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; border: 0.28pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none; width: 87.9pt; height: 85.31pt;\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">초빙부문</span></p></td><td valign=\"middle\" style=\"padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; border: 0.28pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none; width: 348.6pt; height: 85.31pt;\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; font-weight: bold; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 바탕; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">과학</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 바탕; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">물리</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 바탕; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">화학</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 바탕; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">생물</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">○</span><span style=\"font-family: 바탕; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">명</span></p></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"middle\" style=\"background: rgb(214, 214, 214); padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; border: 0.28pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none; width: 87.9pt; height: 85.31pt;\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">지원자격</span></p></td><td valign=\"middle\" style=\"padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; border: 0.28pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none; width: 348.6pt; height: 85.31pt;\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1. </span><span style=\"font-family: 바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">전공과목 석사 이상의 자격소유자 또는 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">5</span><span style=\"font-family: 바탕; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">년 이상의 교육 경험</span><span style=\"font-family: 바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">자</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2. </span><span style=\"font-family: 바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">발도르프 교육학을 원하고 실천의 뜻을 품은 자</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">3. </span><span style=\"font-family: 바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">아이들을 사랑하고 교육에 대해 열정이 있으신 분</span></p></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"middle\" style=\"background: rgb(214, 214, 214); padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; border: 0.28pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none; width: 87.9pt; height: 34.48pt;\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">조    건</span></p></td><td valign=\"middle\" style=\"padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; border: 0.28pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none; width: 348.6pt; height: 34.48pt;\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; letter-spacing: 0pt; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">서울자유발도르프학교에서 제시하는 발도르프 연수에 참여한다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"middle\" style=\"background: rgb(214, 214, 214); padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; border: 0.28pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none; width: 87.9pt; height: 34.48pt;\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">지원서 접수기간</span></p></td><td valign=\"middle\" style=\"padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; border: 0.28pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none; width: 348.6pt; height: 34.48pt;\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">초빙시까지</span></p></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"middle\" style=\"background: rgb(214, 214, 214); padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; border: 0.28pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none; width: 87.9pt; height: 34.48pt;\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">지원서류</span></p></td><td valign=\"middle\" style=\"padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; border: 0.28pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none; width: 348.6pt; height: 34.48pt;\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">자기소개서</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; letter-spacing: 0pt; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">이력서</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: 바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">자유서식</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">사진</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">연락처포함</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span></p></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"middle\" style=\"background: rgb(214, 214, 214); padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; border: 0.28pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none; width: 87.9pt; height: 26.97pt;\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">접수방법</span></p></td><td valign=\"middle\" style=\"padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; border: 0.28pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none; width: 348.6pt; height: 26.97pt;\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕